From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Project Luma <builds@project-luma.local>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:17:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 43/47] media: i2c: add OmniVision OV50D40 image sensor driver

One 2x2-binned mode, 4096x3072 RAW10 at 30 fps on four D-PHY lanes at
1902 Mbps, from a 24 MHz XVCLK, with exposure, analogue gain, VBLANK and
a colour bar test pattern. XVCLK is only checked, never set.

The register settings come from the GPL-2.0 MediaTek imgsensor driver
for this sensor on MT6878 in the Volla kernel modules; PLL, timing and
window settings match the same driver in the CMF Phone 2 Pro (MT6878)
kernel modules.
---
 MAINTAINERS                 |    8 +
 drivers/media/i2c/Kconfig   |   10 +
 drivers/media/i2c/Makefile  |    1 +
 drivers/media/i2c/ov50d40.c | 2325 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 2344 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/media/i2c/ov50d40.c

